Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?GPU:=20texturas=20de=20storage=20grav=C3=A1veis?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20no=20fragment=20shader,=20na=20ordem=20da=20rasteriza=C3=A7?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A3o?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Recurso opcional, pedido na criação do device com
SDL_PROP_GPU_DEVICE_CREATE_FEATURE_GRAPHICS_STORAGE_READ_WRITE_BOOLEAN; sem
ele nada muda para quem usa a SDL.

- API: flag SDL_GPU_TEXTUREUSAGE_GRAPHICS_STORAGE_READ_WRITE, propriedade de
  shader SDL_PROP_GPU_SHADER_CREATE_NUM_READWRITE_STORAGE_TEXTURES_NUMBER,
  SDL_BindGPUFragmentReadWriteStorageTextures() e as propriedades de device
  SDL_PROP_GPU_DEVICE_GRAPHICS_STORAGE_READ_WRITE_BOOLEAN e
  SDL_PROP_GPU_DEVICE_RASTER_ORDERED_STORAGE_BOOLEAN.
- Registros: SPIR-V set 2 depois dos storage buffers; DXIL (u[n], space2)
  com o mesmo n do binding do SPIR-V (é o que o shadercross gera); MSL
  [[texture]] depois das texturas de storage só de leitura.
- D3D12: faixa UAV visível ao pixel shader, descritores UAV, estado padrão
  UNORDERED_ACCESS com barreira UAV no fim do passe, ROVsSupported.
- Vulkan: modo GRAPHICS_STORAGE_READ_WRITE (GENERAL, SHADER_READ|WRITE),
  fragmentStoresAndAtomics, VK_EXT_fragment_shader_interlock com
  fragmentShaderPixelInterlock no pNext, barreira de memória no fim do passe.
- Metal: MTLTextureUsageShaderRead|Write, amarração no fragmento,
  rasterOrderGroupsSupported e readWriteTextureSupport.
